      "options": {
        "content": "HTTP checks cover Proxmox, Nextcloud, the Discord bot and ntfy. ICMP checks cover reachable hosts. Availability is the share of successful recorded probes within the selected period; gaps are visible in the timeline and scrape-health panel.",
